{"id":"c38eeda4-c709-5cae-bc63-2e4223ae0873","title":"核心概念","icon":"🧭","cover":"none","parentId":null,"favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"核心概念","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"九个概念，一张图","title":"ShowAI 里的几样东西","lead":"ShowAI 里的东西不多：内容库装着项目，项目里是文件夹和页面，页面由区块和组件组成，模板和目录负责复用。弄清它们的关系，后面的文档都好读。","facts":[{"label":"容器","value":"页面 · 白板"},{"label":"复用","value":"组件 · 模板"},{"label":"目录作用域","value":"项目 · 全局 · 已发布 · 内置"}],"art":"concepts"},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-ecc28271"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-ebc280de"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"一张图看懂"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"点选任一概念查看定义；带「打开文档」的可以跳到详细说明。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-eac27f4b"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-diagram","version":"1.0.0","props":{"nodes":[{"id":"library","label":"内容库","sub":"~/.showai","col":0,"row":0,"tone":"slate","icon":"🗂️","detail":"一个本机目录，保存全部项目、页面、组件和模板。桌面 App、本地浏览器版、CLI 和 Agent **指向同一个内容库**时，看到的是同一批内容。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/library"},{"id":"project","label":"项目","sub":"同步与权限单位","col":1,"row":0,"tone":"brand","detail":"把相关的页面、文件夹、组件和模板归在一起。项目可以记录宿主工作目录，Agent 在同一目录下的会话会共用这个项目。按项目同步和分配权限。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/quick-start"},{"id":"folder","label":"文件夹","sub":"可多层","col":2,"row":0,"tone":"brand","detail":"项目内的层级分组，只用来组织页面。归档一个文件夹会同时隐藏其中的全部内容。"},{"id":"page","label":"页面","sub":"Page · 顺序","col":1,"row":1,"tone":"brand","detail":"按内容顺序排版的容器，适合笔记、报告和文档。新建内容默认是页面。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/page-board"},{"id":"board","label":"白板","sub":"Board · 空间","col":2,"row":1,"tone":"brand","detail":"可平移、缩放、绘画、自由摆放的容器，适合整理关系和比较方案。页面和白板可以互相嵌套，展开后编辑的仍是**同一个节点**。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/page-board"},{"id":"block","label":"区块","sub":"文字 · 组件","col":1,"row":2,"tone":"teal","detail":"容器里的内容：段落、标题、列表、表格等文本块，以及图表、导图、数据库等组件。非文本区块都有**稳定的 ID**，Agent 和合并都靠它定位。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/components"},{"id":"catalog","label":"组件目录","sub":"内置+自定义","col":0,"row":2,"tone":"violet","detail":"所有可插入的组件。每个组件带说明、参数规则和示例；需要新表达时可以写 React 组件加入目录。页面保存的是组件的**精确版本**。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/components"},{"id":"template","label":"模板","sub":"页面结构","col":0,"row":1,"tone":"violet","detail":"保存内容组织要求和一份基础页面，可以组合子模板。应用时展开成一份独立页面；之后更新模板**不会改变**已经生成的页面。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/components"},{"id":"export","label":"导出","sub":"HTML · 网站","col":3,"row":2,"tone":"warm","detail":"把页面连同阅读器、数据和用到的组件打包成单文件 HTML、会话片段或静态网站。导出是一份快照，源页面之后的修改不会更新旧文件。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/export"}],"edges":[{"from":"library","to":"project","label":"包含"},{"from":"project","to":"folder"},{"from":"folder","to":"page"},{"from":"folder","to":"board"},{"from":"page","to":"board","label":"嵌套","both":true},{"from":"page","to":"block"},{"from":"board","to":"block"},{"from":"catalog","to":"block","label":"插入"},{"from":"template","to":"project","label":"展开","dashed":true},{"from":"block","to":"export","label":"打包"}],"groups":[{"label":"项目里的内容","from":[1,1],"to":[2,2],"tone":"brand"},{"label":"复用","from":[0,1],"to":[0,2],"tone":"violet"}],"caption":"实线表示包含或引用；虚线表示模板只在创建时展开一次。"},"integrity":"sha256-9ceb1b83b7337bd71c87cce10635d090629d4226ec970470ceee8ab26cee0038"},"id":"node-e9c27db8"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-f0c288bd"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"内容库、项目和文件夹"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"内容库","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"是一个本机目录，默认 "},{"type":"text","text":"~/.showai","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。它用事务型 SQLite 保存正式内容，并生成可读的工作区文件；备份和迁移见 "},{"type":"text","text":"内容库与版本","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/library"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-efc2872a"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"项目","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"归集一组相关内容，是同步和权限的单位。"},{"type":"text","text":"文件夹","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"只是项目里的分层，页面记录自己所属的文件夹。下面是从内容库一直到区块的层级，点开查看每一层。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-eec28597"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-tree","version":"1.0.0","props":{"initial":".showai/文献阅读/注意力机制/阅读笔记","caption":"层级示意：内容库 → 项目 → 文件夹 → 页面 → 区块。","nodes":[{"name":".showai","kind":"dir","badge":"内容库","open":true,"summary":"全部内容所在的目录，默认在用户主目录下（`~/.showai`）。","detail":"可在「设置 → 通用 → 内容库」中更换，CLI 用 `--home` 或环境变量 `SHOWAI_HOME` 指定。","children":[{"name":"文献阅读","kind":"dir","badge":"项目","open":true,"summary":"一组相关的页面、文件夹、组件和模板。","detail":"项目内创建、导入或派生的组件与模板只在本项目可见，注册到全局后其他项目才能使用。","children":[{"name":"注意力机制","kind":"dir","badge":"文件夹","open":true,"summary":"项目内的分组，可以多层。","children":[{"name":"阅读笔记","kind":"file","type":"Page","badge":"页面","summary":"一份页面资源，根节点是一个页面容器。","detail":"页面文件包含内容结构、稳定的区块 ID、组件的精确版本引用和参数。标题、图标、所属文件夹等是元数据。","example":"{\n  \"format\": \"showai\",\n  \"version\": 3,\n  \"document\": {\n    \"id\": \"research\",\n    \"title\": \"研究报告\",\n    \"content\": {\n      \"type\": \"surface\",\n      \"attrs\": { \"id\": \"report\", \"kind\": \"page\" },\n      \"content\": [ ... ]\n    },\n    \"layout\": { ... },\n    \"surfaceViews\": { ... }\n  }\n}","exampleLang":"json","open":true,"children":[{"name":"研究问题","kind":"field","type":"heading","summary":"文本块：标题、段落、列表、表格、提示框、折叠块等。"},{"name":"方法比较","kind":"object","type":"widget · table","summary":"组件区块：`kind` 指明组件类型，`data` 是它的参数。"},{"name":"分析白板","kind":"object","type":"surface · board","badge":"嵌套","summary":"嵌在页面里的白板。父级页面决定它的外框，白板决定内部布局。","children":[{"name":"箭头","kind":"field","type":"drawing","summary":"白板上的绘画：画笔、矩形、椭圆或箭头。"}]}]}]},{"name":"研究模板","kind":"file","type":"template","badge":"模板","summary":"项目里保存的模板，应用后生成独立页面。"}]}]}]},"integrity":"sha256-74d9519ab11b450f4d2feec3813ad0e0d8a26b3d1c93510a74c9a765e1578215"},"id":"node-edc28404"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-e4c275d9"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"页面和白板有什么不同"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"两者都是容器，能放同样的内容，区别在排版方式。界面中分别叫「页面」和「白板」。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e3c27446"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-compare","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":[{"id":"page","label":"页面","sub":"Page","tone":"brand"},{"id":"board","label":"白板","sub":"Board","tone":"teal"}],"rows":[{"group":"排版","label":"内容怎么排","values":{"page":"按顺序从上到下","board":"按坐标自由摆放"}},{"group":"排版","label":"阅读方式","values":{"page":"纵向滚动，可选中文字","board":"平移、缩放（10%–400%）"}},{"group":"排版","label":"画笔、形状、箭头","values":{"page":false,"board":true}},{"group":"排版","label":"新建时的默认类型","values":{"page":true,"board":false}},{"group":"嵌进另一个容器时","label":"默认外框","values":{"page":"固定高度的阅读窗口，可改为随内容增长","board":"固定高度窗口，内部绘画不撑开文章"}},{"group":"嵌进另一个容器时","label":"阅读锁","hint":"锁定时禁止缩放和平移，点击和编辑控件照常工作","values":{"page":false,"board":"嵌入时默认锁定"}},{"group":"适合","label":"典型内容","values":{"page":"笔记、报告、文档、网页","board":"关系整理、方案比较、讲解图"}}],"note":"两种容器可以递归嵌套：例如研究报告里放一块分析白板，白板里再放一段详细论证的页面。"},"integrity":"sha256-3a5b6ff02c26c6d04060377c93d47041a961d40fcd062e5944842df3976755d0"},"id":"node-1130f6aa"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"嵌套时"},{"type":"text","text":"父级决定外框，子容器决定内部布局","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。展开一个嵌套容器只是换到更大的工作区，编辑的仍是同一个节点；所有层级共用一个资源文件、一套保存机制和一条撤销历史。详见 "},{"type":"text","text":"Page 与 Board","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/page-board"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1230f83d"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-f30f384"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"组件、模板和目录"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"组件","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"是页面里会动的部分：图表、思维导图、数据库、滑块，或你自己写的 React 组件。每个组件带说明、参数规则和示例，所以 Agent 能挑对组件，而不是临时写一段 HTML。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1030f517"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"模板","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"保存一种页面结构：每个区域要写什么、推荐的组件，以及一份基础页面，还可以组合子模板。应用模板会展开出一份独立页面，之后更新模板不影响它。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d30f05e"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"目录","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"把组件和模板按作用域管理，查找时依次在下面几层寻找："}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e30f1f1"}},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"作用域"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ffceb4d7"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-837503a0"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"里面是什么"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5aa689ac"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-84750533"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"怎么进入"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-561d2b21"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-857506c6"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fc3be8df"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"项目"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b698ca54"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-289d2ecb"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"当前项目里创建、导入或派生的版本"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bb2228df"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-279d2d38"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在项目中保存新版本"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8bf8f47e"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2a9d31f1"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fb3be74c"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"全局"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d860a17d"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f973fa6a"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"本机所有项目都能用的版本"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-33387652"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fa73fbfd"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"明确注册到全局，连同依赖一起复制"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-634f2d53"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f773f744"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fe3bec05"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已发布"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e6f53c3a"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fdfd58f5"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"从网址获取并校验过的发布包"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6c1d3505"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fcfd5762"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"发布校验成功后安装"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f194dfb0"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fbfd55cf"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fd3bea72"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"内置"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a00dcd0b"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d8154b8c"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"随应用提供的组件和模板"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fae5a1e0"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d9154d1f"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"随应用更新；要修改就派生到项目"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-756df735"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-da154eb2"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f83be293"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b30ed38"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"使用方法见 "},{"type":"text","text":"组件与模板","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/components"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"，自己开发见 "},{"type":"text","text":"开发自定义组件","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/component-dev"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c30eecb"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-930ea12"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"版本、修订和草稿"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"「版本」在 ShowAI 里有两种意思，规则不同："}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a30eba5"}},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"页面的修订","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：页面每次保存都会核对你读到的修订（hash）。期间别人或 Agent 改过，保存就被拒绝并返回冲突，而不是悄悄覆盖。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8e6f1b9"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-76718fce"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"组件和模板的版本","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"："},{"type":"text","text":"id + version","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 加内容指纹确定一份不可变的内容。改内容就要存成新版本；在别的项目里修改则先派生，记录来源。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-370108e"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-77719161"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b2eaea1"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"编辑器的"},{"type":"text","text":"草稿","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"保存在本机。保存失败或遇到冲突时，草稿会保留，状态显示「本机草稿已保留」；你可以「比较并合并」，或「保留为副本」。互不冲突的字段会自动合并。详见 "},{"type":"text","text":"内容库与版本","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/library"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a2ead0e"}},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"为什么页面要锁定组件的精确版本？","open":false,"id":"node-92eab7b"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"页面引用组件时记录 "},{"type":"text","text":"componentId","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","text":"version","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 和内容指纹 "},{"type":"text","text":"integrity","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。同名同版本在不同作用域可能是不同内容，只比较名称和版本不足以确认身份。锁定后，组件后来的新版本不会改变已有页面，导出也能带上正确的运行代码。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a07201e4"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-82ea9e8"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"导出"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"导出把页面连同阅读器、数据和用到的组件打包成可交付文件：单文件 HTML、会话片段或静态网站。导出是快照，存放位置与源页面分开，之后修改源页面不会更新已导出的文件。详见 "},{"type":"text","text":"导出与分享","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/export"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f2eb4ed"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-e2eb35a"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"接下来"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":3,"cards":[{"icon":"🧩","title":"Page 与 Board","body":"嵌套、白板工具、阅读锁和快捷键。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/page-board"},{"icon":"🧱","title":"组件与模板","body":"查找、插入、编辑参数，管理版本。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/components"},{"icon":"🗂️","title":"内容库与版本","body":"存储、草稿、冲突与备份。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/library"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-d2eb1c7"}}]},"layout":{},"surfaceViews":{"root":{"initial":null,"saved":[],"readingOrder":["node-ecc28271","node-ebc280de","node-eac27f4b","node-e9c27db8","node-f0c288bd","node-efc2872a","node-eec28597","node-edc28404","node-e4c275d9","node-e3c27446","node-1130f6aa","node-1230f83d","node-f30f384","node-1030f517","node-d30f05e","node-e30f1f1","node-b30ed38","node-c30eecb","node-930ea12","node-a30eba5","node-b2eaea1","node-a2ead0e","node-92eab7b","node-82ea9e8","node-f2eb4ed","node-e2eb35a","node-d2eb1c7"]}},"comments":[]}